表情平静略带冷感与疏离。身穿浅粉色高弹力紧身短款T恤，布料贴合曲线凸显纤细腰腹，下搭水洗蓝磨白牛仔超短裤，裤脚毛边设计，露出修长双腿，外搭白色轻薄休闲西装外套随意披在左肩，衣摆自然垂落，脚踩纯白低帮运动鞋，鞋带系紧，鞋面无污渍，鞋底完整贴合地面。右手持一杯带吸管的草莓牛奶，杯身印有红色心形图案，左手自然垂于身侧，身体微侧站姿，膝盖微曲，脚尖略微外展，脚底完整可见。背景为24小时便利店门口，玻璃门透出店内暖黄灯光与货架轮廓，门上“便利店 24H OPEN”红色霓虹字样清晰可见，地面深灰色水泥地湿漉漉倒映霓虹与招牌，反射出橙红与冷白光斑驳光影，雨滴溅起水花与油渍痕迹，地面分布圆形井盖、红色防滑垫、金属排水格栅，头顶有雨滴垂落，上方留有空间，整体氛围潮湿阴郁，冷色调打光，侧逆光增强轮廓与水渍反光，超写实摄影风格，Moody Photography，韩风冷调街拍氛围感强烈。"]},{"id":8,"type":"CLIPTextEncode","pos":[521.808203125,672],"size":[400,200],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":27},{"localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"条件","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[30,35]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.24.0","Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode"},"widgets_values":[""]},{"id":9,"type":"KSamplerAdvanced","pos":[1391.808203125,130],"size":[270,556],"flags":{},"order":11,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"模型","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":28},{"localized_name":"正面条件","name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","link":29},{"localized_name":"负面条件","name":"negative","type":"CONDITIONING","link":30},{"localized_name":"Latent图像","name":"latent_image","type":"LATENT","link":31},{"localized_name":"添加噪波","name":"add_noise","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"add_noise"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"随机种","name":"noise_seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"noise_seed"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"步数","name":"steps","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"steps"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"cfg","name":"cfg","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"cfg"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"采样器名称","name":"sampler_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"sampler_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"调度器","name":"scheduler","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"scheduler"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"开始步数","name":"start_at_step","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"start_at_step"},"link":null},{"localized_name